 4. You can now:
    - **Subscribe/Unsubscribe Data Streams:** Select streams and click **"Subscribe Data"** or **"Unsubscribe Data"**.
    - **Start/Stop Recording:** Enter a title and click **"Start Record"**/**"Stop Record"**.
